{"title":"2021 USAMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/8/83870118206bd0e612b5c9e3def2ef95460e368b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be an integer. Find all positive real solutions to the following system of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93f5c51ea4b04b4992b003b39479f29018f6bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/a/a4a29f6380320a65271911c5b6ba127368139c1b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a_{1} &amp;=\\frac{1}{a_{2 n}}+\\frac{1}{a_{2}}, &amp; a_{2}&amp;=a_{1}+a_{3}, \\\\ a_{3}&amp;=\\frac{1}{a_{2}}+\\frac{1}{a_{4}}, &amp; a_{4}&amp;=a_{3}+a_{5}, \\\\ a_{5}&amp;=\\frac{1}{a_{4}}+\\frac{1}{a_{6}}, &amp; a_{6}&amp;=a_{5}+a_{7} \\\\ &amp;\\vdots &amp; &amp;\\vdots \\\\ a_{2 n-1}&amp;=\\frac{1}{a_{2 n-2}}+\\frac{1}{a_{2 n}}, &amp; a_{2 n}&amp;=a_{2 n-1}+a_{1} \\end{align*}\" width=\"377\" height=\"217\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The unique positive real solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebb156c4d877dd2c6f3c1284f7f4916f53f68163.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2k-1} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/b/65b7ce338933a1aecdd5efb09ea5d7352c3f9bf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2k} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/810bc3b19926c7e47659a31b7a3e7d177f1fd281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le k \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>First, substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/2/56269c7a7d7ef0f7e455160b2660d1432c7827c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2k-1} = \\frac{1}{a_{2k-2}} + \\frac{1}{a_{2k}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"163\" height=\"42\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/907e744d110badf1da5c5570dbf55e399e57b8f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"72\" height=\"53\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8a7fb93911b78a92a85577488fda54fec24c5e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1}^2 = \\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1}\\left(\\frac{1}{a_{2k-2}} + \\frac{1}{a_{2k}}\\right) = \\sum_{k=1}^n \\frac{a_{2k-1} + a_{2k+1}}{a_{2k}}\\]\" width=\"449\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/0/920f6e61321f8abe174cc65a62cd01a86ece3186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2k} = a_{2k-1} + a_{2k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"16\" />, this simplifies to:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509ad9fa4698da5641ac9166dcd1e57e645ccc5c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1}^2 = \\sum_{k=1}^n \\frac{a_{2k}}{a_{2k}} = n\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Next, expand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67bc09ff1bcb8081afd9c26179d99e772c6401c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1} a_{2k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"96\" height=\"53\" /> in two ways:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14be44bcfc4ec2ea583e261e0038cf03eb6c2b76.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1} a_{2k} = \\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k}\\left(\\frac{1}{a_{2k-2}} + \\frac{1}{a_{2k}}\\right) = n + \\sum_{k=1}^n \\frac{a_{2k}}{a_{2k-2}}\\]\" width=\"426\" height=\"48\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a06425a68d3432ce31773336cb4e72f9b05214.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1} a_{2k} = \\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1}(a_{2k-1} + a_{2k+1}) = \\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1}^2 + \\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1} a_{2k+1} = n + \\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1} a_{2k+1}\\]\" width=\"677\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Equating the two expressions gives:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36b1ea220545e1656d1960b350d9e9428472ca19.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1} a_{2k+1} = \\sum_{k=1}^n \\frac{a_{2k}}{a_{2k-2}}\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>By AM-GM and Cauchy-Schwarz:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/f/bcf546ec0758f999de23b82d84c169140e50ebcb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^n \\frac{a_{2k}}{a_{2k-2}} \\ge n \\sqrt[n]{\\prod_{k=1}^n \\frac{a_{2k}}{a_{2k-2}}} = n\\]\" width=\"237\" height=\"63\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/4/2843f23cd93492538921dfbc493433f776220ac7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1} a_{2k+1} \\le \\sqrt{\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k-1}^2} \\sqrt{\\sum_{k=1}^n a_{2k+1}^2} = n\\]\" width=\"347\" height=\"63\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/01274380fe3a3ccfa10cbe94ccbfaa291e2356f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le \\sum \\frac{a_{2k}}{a_{2k-2}} = \\sum a_{2k-1} a_{2k+1} \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"282\" height=\"38\" />, forcing equality everywhere:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Equality in AM-GM gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d0801e3542478949f1897f924afd90b201615cb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = a_4 = \\dots = a_{2n} = E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"17\" />.</li>\n<li>Equality in Cauchy-Schwarz gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891e7f2c34d28dd62b0b9d39576efd4d2bbe0fa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = a_3 = \\dots = a_{2n-1} = O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"211\" height=\"18\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/4/8a48afb777d81e08ac3ef6ca409093eae5970adf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = a_1 + a_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/1/641b419c7aee2c5202b6c909b9a8042095b9c36f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = \\frac{1}{a_{2n}} + \\frac{1}{a_2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"116\" height=\"41\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/3/333e1b57afcc2d85df6c972906acb425280610ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E = 2O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d2b9b0fd047f2db38609a568700bc1f883c0b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O = \\frac{2}{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/6/436b6e05c8b3a5d466e8b3955c919cff75c8a545.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2O^2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"17\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027fe855087a65a2819afceee037cca88a3453dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e0880df1c49c9ceb05ead70c76a268a02266b87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebb156c4d877dd2c6f3c1284f7f4916f53f68163.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2k-1} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/b/65b7ce338933a1aecdd5efb09ea5d7352c3f9bf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2k} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/810bc3b19926c7e47659a31b7a3e7d177f1fd281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le k \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also_2\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO\" title=\"2021 USAMO\">2021 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2021 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2021\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO\" title=\"2021 USAJMO\">2021 USAJMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO_Problems\" title=\"2021 USAJMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=176&amp;year=2021\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2021 USAJMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 USAJMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 USAJMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 USAJMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 USAJMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2021 USAJMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_USAJMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 USAJMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAJMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAJMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAJMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017110910\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 222/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2272/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 102/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6523/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.381      1 -total\n 62.11%   19.490      1 Template:USAJMO_newbox\n 21.23%    6.662      1 Template:USAMO_newbox\n 15.57%    4.887      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21836:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017110910 and revision id 291301. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}